{"id":"5036bba7ca747e71","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-small-site.md","title":"Definition — Small Site","display":"Definition — Small Site","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-small-site","aliases":["14-df-small-site"],"display":"Definition — Small Site","depends_on":["[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-small-site"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-small-site</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Small Site"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCategory}\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}\\)</span> (Grothendieck-topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSite}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSite}\\)</span> (site predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.2 Grothendieck Topologies。</p>\n<p>本库的站点限定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小站点，确保集合值预层和筛族构造的尺寸闭合。原书也讨论某些较大背景；本条不覆盖未指定宇宙的任意大站点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsCategory}$ (category predicate, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}$ (Grothendieck-topology predicate, see [[14-df-grothendieck-topology]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsCategory}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false}],"bytes":1041,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-small-site|Definition — Small Site]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-small-site]]"},{"id":"b75f5f3e37180e81","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-small-site]]"},{"id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点（[[14-df-small-site]]）。$F$ 为候选预层；$\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)$ 是 [[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]] 定义的相容族集合。满子范畴见 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-small-site]]"},{"id":"3a8105e59309bc16","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-small-site|Definition — Small Site]]"},{"id":"5d8dd49e5f3240a8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fd293da57bc98716","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 满足 [[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]] 的 Giraud 条件；站点与层范畴见 [[14-df-small-site]]、[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]；小指 $\\mathcal U$-小。"},{"id":"e8b8317e69a22cc8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSite}$ (site predicate, se